#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:5
#: 4384a58e14df4bfc83f2afe934d440b9
msgid "Autorotation"
msgstr "自转"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:8
#: 2667b6b7ba744273a4dd8d9bf421b1e1
msgid "Practice (Manual) Autorotation Setup"
msgstr "练习（手动）自转设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:10
#: aeee9720bd35412e82e74a46b9211e2b
msgid ""
"In versions 4.4 and later, the ability to conduct power re-engagement from "
"an autorotation has been added.  This feature will work with ESC's using "
"their built-in governor, the ardupilot throttle curve or the ardupilot "
"built-in governor.  Three parameters were added to accommodate this feature."
msgstr ""
"在 4.4 及更高版本中，新增了从自转状态重新接合动力的功能。该功能可与使用内置调速器的 ESC、ArduPilot 油门曲线或 ArduPilot "
"内置调速器配合使用。为支持此功能，新增了三个参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:12
#: 94f3d65472de4b5dbf38521552a37484
msgid ""
":ref:`H_RSC_AROT_ENBL <H_RSC_AROT_ENBL>` - Enables manual autorotations (0 -"
" Disable, 1 - Enable)"
msgstr ":ref:`H_RSC_AROT_ENBL <H_RSC_AROT_ENBL>` - 启用手动自转（0 - 禁用，1 - 启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:13
#: 683443d5ef04432a879c6ba493d5e1b7
msgid ""
":ref:`H_RSC_AROT_RAMP <H_RSC_AROT_RAMP>` - Time to ramp throttle back to "
"motorlock enabled value during power recovery in seconds"
msgstr ":ref:`H_RSC_AROT_RAMP <H_RSC_AROT_RAMP>` - 动力恢复期间，油门升回电机联锁启用值所需的时间（秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:14
#: b8dc5fac45694e5e9edd75c1d3dac676
msgid ""
":ref:`H_RSC_AROT_IDLE <H_RSC_AROT_IDLE>` - Idle throttle value in percent "
"used during autorotation.  This can be set to the value that signals the ESC"
" to perform a fast spool-up when performing a power recovery."
msgstr ""
":ref:`H_RSC_AROT_IDLE <H_RSC_AROT_IDLE>` - 自转期间使用的怠速油门值（百分比）。可将其设置为通知 ESC "
"在动力恢复时执行快速加速的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:17
#: e2877a31fba44d84a2d90c0e221d415a
msgid "ESC Governor"
msgstr "ESC 调速器"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:19
#: bd2594bb812447c8857a4740bf052418
msgid ""
"Enable manual autoratation by setting :ref:`H_RSC_AROT_ENBL "
"<H_RSC_AROT_ENBL>` to 1.  Leave :ref:`H_RSC_AROT_RAMP <H_RSC_AROT_RAMP>` at "
"the default setting of 1 second to quickly signal the ESC for fast spool-up."
"  Set the throttle idle value, :ref:`H_RSC_AROT_IDLE <H_RSC_AROT_IDLE>`, to "
"the percent of throttle given by the ESC manual that signals the ESC to "
"perform a fast spool-up."
msgstr ""
"通过将 :ref:`H_RSC_AROT_ENBL <H_RSC_AROT_ENBL>` 设为 1 来启用手动自转。将 "
":ref:`H_RSC_AROT_RAMP <H_RSC_AROT_RAMP>` 保持默认值 1 秒，以快速向 ESC 发出快速加速信号。将油门怠速值 "
":ref:`H_RSC_AROT_IDLE <H_RSC_AROT_IDLE>` 设置为 ESC 手册中指示 ESC 执行快速加速的油门百分比。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:22
#: 303b1c1246474b9ba9f1c4d2fe51bb3f
msgid "Ardupilot's Throttle Curve or Built-in Governor"
msgstr "ArduPilot 油门曲线或内置调速器"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:24
#: 4507a58cb52d4c76bfab214808452e34
msgid ""
"Enable manual autoratation by setting :ref:`H_RSC_AROT_ENBL "
"<H_RSC_AROT_ENBL>` to 1.  Set :ref:`H_RSC_AROT_RAMP <H_RSC_AROT_RAMP>` to "
"bring the throttle back to the throttle curve quickly.  One to two seconds "
"woudld be sufficient.  If desired, the throttle idle value, "
":ref:`H_RSC_AROT_IDLE <H_RSC_AROT_IDLE>`, can be set to a higher value for "
"ICE engines to remain at a higher engine RPM in the descent.  For electric "
"engines using the throttle curve or built-in governor, set it to zero."
msgstr ""
"通过将 :ref:`H_RSC_AROT_ENBL <H_RSC_AROT_ENBL>` 设为 1 来启用手动自转。设置 "
":ref:`H_RSC_AROT_RAMP <H_RSC_AROT_RAMP>` 以快速将油门升回油门曲线。1 到 2 秒应该足够。如有需要，对于 "
"ICE 发动机，油门怠速值 :ref:`H_RSC_AROT_IDLE <H_RSC_AROT_IDLE>` "
"可设置为较高值，以便在下降过程中保持较高的发动机转速。对于使用油门曲线或内置调速器的电动发动机，将其设为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:27
#: 2d0250f6224644f8bf8a4b770836e861
msgid "Semi-Autonomous Autorotation Setup"
msgstr "半自主自转设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-autorotation.rst:29
#: 2508721290d14e0aabae8aaa567e4fba
msgid ""
"Future enhancement to provide autonomous control during autorotation is "
"planned as a new flight mode. Currently under development, the current state"
" of the project can be tried under :ref:`SITL Simulation <sitl-simulator-"
"software-in-the-loop>`. See :ref:`traditional-helicopter-autorotation-mode`"
msgstr ""
"未来计划将自转期间的自主控制增强作为新飞行模式。目前正在开发中，可在 :ref:`SITL Simulation <sitl-simulator-"
"software-in-the-loop>` 下试用该项目的当前状态。参见 :ref:`traditional-helicopter-"
"autorotation-mode`"
